Quality Creation & Distribution Project)

2
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:29,530
♪Black hair twines around bone♪

3
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:35,360
♪Night dew cold♪

4
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:39,740
♪Bronze mirror cracks
through three lifetimes♪

5
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:44,030
♪Shines on the sleepless♪

6
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:48,580
♪Yunmeng Marsh ebbs and flows♪

7
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:52,730
♪Vows sink deep♪

8
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:58,350
♪White-hair curse turns to snow♪

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:01:03,160
♪Covering the realm♪

10
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:11,060
=Reunion Across Time=

11
00:01:11,060 --> 00:01:14,080
=Episode 14=

12
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:17,560
You're beating your pregnant wife
in the street!

13
00:01:17,840 --> 00:01:19,880
Do you think Chu State has no laws?

14
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,960
A woman like her

15
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,280
deserves to be beaten to death.

16
00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:26,760
Wait,

17
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,480
what business is it of yours?

18
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:31,080
Don't tell me you're the one she's been

19
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,160
sleeping with.

20
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:33,400
(The other man?)

21
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,080
(So he really is the other man!)

22
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,400
How dare you!

23
00:01:37,120 --> 00:01:39,120
This is Diviner Song Ziyuan
of Chu State.

24
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,640
How dare you speak so recklessly?

25
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,040
Diviner Song...

26
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,640
I meant no offense.

27
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,120
Please forgive me, Diviner Song.

28
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:48,960
Forgive me.

29
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:51,160
You treat your pregnant wife

30
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,880
with such cruelty.

31
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,560
Without verifying
whether she's innocent,

32
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:56,600
you've already ruined her reputation.

33
00:01:57,040 --> 00:01:58,720
That's no way for a man to behave.

34
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,520
But...

35
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:02,920
But everyone on the street
is talking about it!

36
00:02:03,080 --> 00:02:04,080
So what?

37
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:06,160
Does that make it true?

38
00:02:06,440 --> 00:02:07,120
But...

39
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,720
But if the child in her belly

40
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,120
were normal,

41
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:11,920
why would it make sounds at night

42
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:13,600
like an old man muttering?

43
00:02:15,640 --> 00:02:16,400
What?

44
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,560
If she hadn't seen a physician
behind my back,

45
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,680
and he hadn't spread the word,

46
00:02:22,040 --> 00:02:22,920
I'd never have known

47
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,920
she was

48
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,400
carrying a monster.

49
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:26,880
Who knows

50
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,440
what evil creature she slept with?

51
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:30,400
Either way, it can't be my child!

52
00:02:30,600 --> 00:02:32,600
That's not true!
I didn't do anything like that!

53
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:34,760
That physician has such a loose tongue.

54
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:39,200
A physician who reveals
a patient's medical condition

55
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:40,640
deserves punishment.

56
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,920
You should have investigated thoroughly

57
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,120
before drawing conclusions.

58
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,280
Moreover,

59
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,480
you should never have
raised a hand to her.

60
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,400
Yes, yes.

61
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:56,960
Everyone, disperse.

62
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,840
Don't spread rumors.

63
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,080
Move along.

64
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,560
Come home with me now.

65
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:04,680
Stop embarrassing me in public.

66
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,440
Wait.

67
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:06,800
If you go home with him,

68
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,400
you'll hardly fare any better.

69
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,120
Besides,

70
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,160
there's something wrong with her belly.

71
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,400
Let's take her back with us first.

72
00:03:17,640 --> 00:03:18,480
Ma'am,

73
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:19,640
what's your name?

74
00:03:20,160 --> 00:03:21,640
I'm Xia Ying.

75
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,880
You beat your pregnant wife.

76
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:29,440
You've failed as a husband
and as a father.

77
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:32,320
I'll take your wife back
and look after her.

78
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,920
As for the evil presence,

79
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:35,680
I will get to the bottom of it.

80
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,800
Thank you, Diviner Song.

81
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:39,720
This way, ma'am.

82
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:40,840
Wait...

83
00:03:41,440 --> 00:03:42,080
Hold on...

84
00:03:44,600 --> 00:03:45,240
This...

85
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:52,560
Xiuxiu?

86
00:03:53,440 --> 00:03:54,160
Xiuxiu!

87
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,560
Xiuxiu!

88
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,080
Xiuxiu!

89
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,240
(Why is it gone again?)

90
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,280
(Such a mischievous thing.)

91
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,760
Haven't you seen it either?

92
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:04,920
(Could it be)

93
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,320
(that it was discovered?)

94
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,480
You scared the hell out of me!

95
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:16,520
Could you stop

96
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:17,880
sneaking up on me?

97
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,560
Looking for your little friend again?

98
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,280
Yes.

99
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,040
Mrs. Zhao is settled in.

100
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,400
What's wrong with
the child in her belly?

101
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,200
When I ran into her today,

102
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:33,840
I faintly caught

103
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,720
the same scent on her
as on that shamanic bamboo slip.

104
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:37,840
At first I thought

105
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:39,720
maybe my nose was playing tricks on me.

106
00:04:40,400 --> 00:04:42,600
But when her husband mentioned
something strange about her belly,

107
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,200
I began to suspect something.

108
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:46,760
So we

109
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,280
wait for her to give birth?

110
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,960
If she can give birth at all...

111
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:55,800
Master.

112
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,360
Miss Chu Li.

113
00:04:58,760 --> 00:05:00,560
You and your master have
the same annoying habit.

114
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,280
I found this at the door just now.

115
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:07,680
No idea who left it or when.

116
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,560
What is it? So mysterious.

117
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,720
Can't I take a look?

118
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,240
It doesn't concern you.

119
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:21,440
Fine.

120
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:23,960
(Silly girl,)

121
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:27,000
(inside the box is Xiuxiu.)

122
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:35,120
Is that...

123
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,040
Xiuxiu?

124
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:44,160
You'd better not look.

125
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:44,960
Let me see!

126
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,400
Lanruo.

127
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:56,720
It must be Lanruo's doing!

128
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:02,760
Chu Li,

129
00:06:03,280 --> 00:06:04,280
calm down.

130
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,440
It's all my fault.

131
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,320
I shouldn't have been so curious.

132
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,880
Xiuxiu kept me company
for so many years.

133
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,400
I'm going to kill that woman!

134
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:15,280
You can't go.

135
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:15,920
Let go of me!

136
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,320
- Listen to me. Lanruo is dangerous!
- Let me go!

137
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,120
Let me go!

138
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:18,600
Didn't you ask me

139
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:20,080
if I had memories of my previous life?

140
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,560
Now I can tell you.

141
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:34,520
Yes.

142
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:38,480
I do remember
what happened in my previous life.

143
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,600
But in my memory,

144
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,400
there is no Lanruo at all.

145
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,560
Your previous life...

146
00:06:50,640 --> 00:06:52,400
Then who exactly is this Lanruo?

147
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:55,080
Why were you reincarnated with me?

148
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,200
I'm so confused.

149
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,040
I'm truly so confused.

150
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,120
Chu Li? Chu Li!

151
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,200
Chu Li!

152
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,520
Listen to me.

153
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:09,720
We still have time.

154
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:12,080
We still have time to figure this out.

155
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,120
Don't panic.

156
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,680
Something's wrong. Let's go.

157
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:25,000
Mrs. Zhao, what happened?

158
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:27,800
It...

159
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,080
It...

160
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:31,800
Master,

161
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:32,760
I just heard

162
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,040
a woman screaming.

163
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,080
Everything's fine here. Leave us.

164
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:41,080
Understood.

165
00:07:45,960 --> 00:07:47,360
(I'm so cold.)

166
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:52,000
Let's help Mrs. Zhao to the bed first.

167
00:07:52,640 --> 00:07:53,280
All right.

168
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,120
Come on.

169
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,280
Careful.

170
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,560
Mrs. Zhao,

171
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:02,080
what happened exactly?

172
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,480
Before, its voice

173
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,440
seemed to come from inside my belly,

174
00:08:06,640 --> 00:08:07,800
laughing and murmuring.

175
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:08,960
But just now, it...

176
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,000
(Save me.)

177
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,480
It suddenly spoke!

178
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,160
(Save me.)

179
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,240
(Save me.)

180
00:08:16,160 --> 00:08:17,480
(Save me!)

181
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:19,640
(Save me!)

182
00:08:21,200 --> 00:08:23,840
(Save me! Save me!)

183
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,960
(Where are you going?)

184
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:57,640
Well?

185
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,520
How long

186
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:03,080
has this been happening?

187
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:06,120
It started about

188
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,240
two months ago.

189
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:09,760
At that time,

190
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:12,400
I was already more than
six months pregnant.

191
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:15,320
Because my husband snored at night

192
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,920
and kept me awake,

193
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:19,160
we started sleeping separately.

194
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,800
One night,

195
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,080
I suddenly heard

196
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,800
a sound from inside my belly.

197
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,840
I thought I'd misheard
because I was so nervous.

198
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,040
But then

199
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,640
it grew more and more frequent.

200
00:09:30,320 --> 00:09:31,880
I didn't dare tell my husband,

201
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,760
so I secretly went to see a physician.

202
00:09:34,520 --> 00:09:35,520
That physician...

203
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:37,560
It was bad enough he couldn't cure me.

204
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:40,080
Then he told everyone about it!

205
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,200
The rumor spread

206
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:43,280
until people said

207
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,480
I had slept with an evil creature.

208
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,720
My husband believed the physician

209
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,880
and wanted to...

210
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,360
That physician should treat patients,

211
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:55,680
not gossip about them!

212
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:57,640
Miss Chu Li,

213
00:09:58,200 --> 00:10:00,320
I don't know
what evil has taken hold of me,

214
00:10:00,760 --> 00:10:03,040
but the child in my belly is innocent.

215
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:05,480
It's due in just over a month.

216
00:10:06,040 --> 00:10:06,960
You're a shamaness.

217
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:07,920
Please think of something.

218
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,200
Save my child.

219
00:10:09,760 --> 00:10:10,680
I'm willing to serve you

220
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,960
like a beast of burden.

221
00:10:12,040 --> 00:10:13,400
Mrs. Zhao, please get up.

222
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,120
Rest assured.

223
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:16,960
We...

224
00:10:19,960 --> 00:10:21,200
We'll do our best to find a way.

225
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,400
How do you plan to help her?

226
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,080
Trace it to the source.

227
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:43,680
Both Xizhao's and Zhong Jiang's

228
00:10:43,960 --> 00:10:45,320
tragedies were born

229
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,600
of their own obsessions.

230
00:10:47,640 --> 00:10:48,680
I doubt that evil afflicted Mrs. Zhao

231
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,040
for no reason.

232
00:10:52,280 --> 00:10:53,000
Right.

233
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,600
And Xiuxiu...

234
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:56,240
I won't let it die for nothing.

235
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,200
I will get to the bottom

236
00:10:58,400 --> 00:10:59,760
of all of this

237
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,480
and avenge Xiuxiu.

238
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:05,560
Song Ziyuan,

239
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,160
now

240
00:11:07,680 --> 00:11:09,040
you can tell me everything, can't you?

241
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,920
Nice weather we're having, huh?

242
00:11:14,640 --> 00:11:15,480
Wait for me!

243
00:11:20,520 --> 00:11:21,240
Song Ziyuan,

244
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:22,640
why did you kill me?

245
00:11:23,600 --> 00:11:24,360
In my previous life,

246
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:27,000
I thought you were setting up
some kind of evil formation,

247
00:11:27,280 --> 00:11:28,480
- so I...
- You're lying.

248
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:36,360
You already knew me in our past life.

249
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,480
Otherwise,

250
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:38,840
why did you call me Li?

251
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,480
Why did you say sorry to me?

252
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,200
Don't think I don't remember.

253
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:45,360
Because in our past life,

254
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,000
I secretly admired you.

255
00:11:49,560 --> 00:11:50,720
I had feelings for you.

256
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,640
I was afraid you'd sacrifice your life

257
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:53,720
to turn back time,

258
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:54,480
so I...

259
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:56,120
But you were a high official
of Chu State,

260
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,000
and I was a shamaness
who'd been driven out.

261
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,120
How did you come to know me?

262
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:03,680
That's none of your concern.

263
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,720
I don't believe you.

264
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,920
You must still be
hiding something from me.

265
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,720
Whether to believe it or not

266
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,880
is up to you.

267
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,520
So...

268
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:16,280
You've been urging the King
to move the capital

269
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:19,080
because you know about
the city's destruction, right?

270
00:12:19,520 --> 00:12:20,080
Yes.

271
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,360
But that's for me to deal with.

272
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,080
You only need to leave before then.

273
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:26,400
You needn't

274
00:12:26,760 --> 00:12:27,760
worry about everything else.

275
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:28,840
And if in the end,

276
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,440
the King still refuses
to move the capital,

277
00:12:30,920 --> 00:12:32,160
will you not leave Jinan City either?

278
00:12:32,960 --> 00:12:33,760
I won't leave.

279
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:36,440
And if I don't leave either?

280
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,800
You must leave.

281
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,400
Chu Li,

282
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:54,880
there's no need for you to die here.

283
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:57,280
Whatever happens in Jinan City

284
00:12:57,880 --> 00:12:58,960
has nothing to do with you.

285
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:06,480
Song Ziyuan.

286
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:10,760
Then right now,

287
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,400
do you still care about me?

288
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:20,720
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

289
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:21,480
It's late.

290
00:13:22,080 --> 00:13:23,080
Go back and take a rest.

291
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:26,510
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

292
00:13:26,510 --> 00:13:29,700
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

293
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,520
Can't wake her?

294
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,360
It's only been one night.

295
00:13:57,680 --> 00:13:58,840
How did she get so bad overnight?

296
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:15,960
What did you find?

297
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:17,480
Last night,

298
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,480
someone used shamanic arts on her.

299
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,880
That's why she's been unconscious.

300
00:14:24,520 --> 00:14:25,240
Chu Li?

301
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,240
Diviner Song?

302
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,040
Why are you two here?

303
00:14:30,280 --> 00:14:31,120
Who is she?

304
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:33,880
Go play.

305
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:34,720
Don't come over.

306
00:14:35,880 --> 00:14:36,680
All right.

307
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,600
Fusheng.

308
00:14:40,600 --> 00:14:42,360
Did you hear anything last night?

309
00:14:44,920 --> 00:14:46,040
Last night,

310
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:47,600
I thought I heard someone calling,

311
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:50,160
so I followed Shiqi over to take a look.

312
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,640
But I saw you two were busy,

313
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:53,840
so I didn't come in to disturb you.

314
00:14:54,520 --> 00:14:55,640
Did something happen?

315
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:57,400
No.

316
00:14:57,720 --> 00:14:58,480
Go out and play.

317
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,800
Got it.

318
00:15:08,720 --> 00:15:09,680
Don't you think

319
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:11,240
Fusheng is acting strange?

320
00:15:13,320 --> 00:15:14,280
You suspect him?

321
00:15:17,510 --> 00:15:24,250
♪Night rain falls in the courtyard,
shining on mortal partings♪

322
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:31,330
♪Strangers meet again,
past lives gleam in endless hues♪

323
00:15:31,700 --> 00:15:35,030
♪A sharp arrow pierces memory♪

324
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:38,400
♪Longing spreads like dye♪

325
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:45,380
♪Beaded curtains
keep love and hate apart♪

326
00:15:45,810 --> 00:15:52,460
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

327
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:59,120
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪

328
00:15:59,290 --> 00:16:02,720
♪That year,
pear blossoms, verse, and laughter♪

329
00:16:02,980 --> 00:16:06,190
♪One night, snow fell in wild flurries♪

330
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:13,110
♪All perfection in this world
hides regret♪

331
00:16:13,470 --> 00:16:17,000
♪A drop of heart's blood seals love♪

332
00:16:17,150 --> 00:16:20,720
♪No more longing enters dreams♪

333
00:16:21,110 --> 00:16:27,560
♪When all turns to mist,
may you and I be safe forever♪

334
00:16:56,460 --> 00:17:03,130
♪Through boundless grief,
love remains hard to sever♪

335
00:17:03,390 --> 00:17:09,680
♪A past bond, a parting dream;
when cold ends, purest joy remains♪
